        <mxCell id="notes" value="CONSTRAINTS AND IMPLEMENTATION NOTES&lt;br/&gt;PK = primary key (implicitly NOT NULL); FK = foreign key; UQ = unique; NN = NOT NULL; NULL = optional.&lt;br/&gt;All FK columns reference the labelled parent PK. IDs: BIGINT GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY, except shared PKs in FEEDBACK and COMPLAINT_EMBEDDINGS.&lt;br/&gt;ROLES.role_name CHECK IN (REPORTER, STAFF, ADMIN). CATEGORIES UNIQUE(department_id, category_name).&lt;br/&gt;COMPLAINTS.priority CHECK IN (LOW, MEDIUM, HIGH, URGENT). Status values: SUBMITTED, ASSIGNED, IN_PROGRESS, RESOLVED, REJECTED.&lt;br/&gt;STATUS_HISTORY uses the same status domain; old_status may be NULL for initial entry.&lt;br/&gt;CHECK (resolved_at IS NULL OR resolved_at &amp;gt;= created_at); CHECK ((status = RESOLVED) = (resolved_at IS NOT NULL)).&lt;br/&gt;ASSIGNMENTS CHECK (ended_at IS NULL OR ended_at &amp;gt;= assigned_at). UNIQUE INDEX ON ASSIGNMENTS(complaint_id) WHERE ended_at IS NULL.&lt;br/&gt;FEEDBACK CHECK (rating BETWEEN 1 AND 5). CATEGORIES CHECK (target_hours &amp;gt; 0). All descriptive name/title/location fields must be nonblank.&lt;br/&gt;Role checks, transition rules, feedback eligibility and audit writes are not enforced by foreign keys alone; use triggers / authorized backend transactions.&lt;br/&gt;pgvector: VECTOR(384), one fixed 384-dimensional model; cosine distance. content_hash = SHA-256 of embedded text; regenerate vectors after text edits." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=15;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="1370" width="1835" height="280" as="geometry" />
